<div class="eoc-pool-shell"><div class="eoc-section-title"><span>Shared coins · {{total}} total</span>{{#if gm}}<div class="eoc-inline"><button type="button" data-action="manage" data-operation="remove" title="Remove one Fortune coin">−</button><button type="button" data-action="manage" data-operation="add" title="Add one Fortune coin">+</button><button type="button" data-action="manage" data-operation="reset">New session</button></div>{{/if}}</div>
<div class="eoc-pool-bowls">{{#each pools}}<section class="eoc-pool-bowl {{key}}"><h2>{{label}} <strong>{{value}}</strong></h2><div class="eoc-coins">{{#each coins}}<button type="button" data-action="spend" data-pool="{{../key}}" title="Spend 1 {{../label}}" {{#if ../disabled}}disabled{{/if}}><img src="{{../image}}" alt="{{../label}} coin"></button>{{/each}}</div><button type="button" data-action="spend" data-pool="{{key}}" {{#if disabled}}disabled{{/if}}>Spend {{label}}</button></section>{{/each}}</div><p>Spent coins move to the other pool. Misfortune can only be spent by the GM.</p>{{#unless connected}}<p>A GM must be connected to spend coins.</p>{{/unless}}</div>
